From 6d6485a46a7660855b8a7f3b12bec8280475d3ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 00:21:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: reliable focus actuators on
 the OnePlus 8 Pro

The AK7377 actuators of the main and ultrawide camera could fail at power up, and the ultrawide lens was then disabled until the next boot.

Signed-off-by: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
---
